  "tensions": [
    "PKD yields to Malebranche's refutation of solipsism, yet the 2-3-74 visions seem to privilege his own mind's perception",
    "If God is the sole agent via occasionalism, how can human choice (justified acts) be meaningful?",
    "Gnostic dualism (transmundane power) appears to conflict with theistic pantheism ('we see all things in God')",
    "Spinoza's closed-system determinism is rejected, yet Spinozan infinity is precisely what PKD glimpsed on Saturday night",
    "The claim that info is negentropy appears mechanistic, yet negentropy is claimed as divine and mystical",
    "Eschatological time collapses 2000 years joyfully, yet Paul's theology is historically located; how do these coexist?",
    "Female perception (himself as female to male Christ) conflicts with his intellectual framework",
    "The machinery of retribution is both a closed system and something Christ must overcome—unclear resolution"
  ],
  "evidence_quotes": [
    "what for me finally clinches it is my realization / perception/conception of last Saturday night of the 'attribute' (to use Spinoza's term) of infinity; this is -as I have said - not physical or spatial infinity (extension) but rather an infinity of what is best called meaning or significance.",
    "The Logos is living info'; that it is negentropy perse a new religious idea. Found first in 'Ubik' info that concerns itself: it is what it describes... it is a kind of info that is what it refers to e.g. King Felix refers to Christ + is Christ",
    "in 2-3-74 I was perceiving myself - the two-mirrors phenomenon - which is to say, thinking about oe own thinking. Christ is in me (this accords with the Cartesian representation-of world theory/realization); viz: when I saw Christ (i.e. Valis) in + as world, this was really myself viewing myself as if from outside",
    "justification is an adjustment in the cosmic order... a sharp, radical change of your status (An improved status) in the cosmic order that cannot be explained mechanistically + could not occur in the Greco Babylonian closed system",
    "I just had a terrifying insight: the man shut up in Darkness in 'Tears' who emits the 'single dreadful shrick' is the crucified Christ - Jason Taverner (who is also Dionysos/Zagreus.) yet also the white-bearded old king on horse. back is Christ as eschatological judge!"
  ],
